{"id":"dafcf622ba5daa59","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-df-zfc-pcf3-scale-ugly-point.md","title":"ZFC Pcf3 Scale Ugly Point","display":"df-zfc-pcf3-scale-ugly-point — ZFC Pcf3 Scale Ugly Point","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-pcf3-scale-ugly-point","aliases":["58-df-zfc-pcf3-scale-ugly-point"],"display":"df-zfc-pcf3-scale-ugly-point — ZFC Pcf3 Scale Ugly Point","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-pcf2-scale.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-pcf3-scale-ugly-point"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-pcf3-scale-ugly-point</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-pcf3-scale-ugly-point — ZFC Pcf3 Scale Ugly Point"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"255774e81caebda9\" href=\"?note=255774e81caebda9\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-zfc-pcf2-scale.md\">../batch03/58-df-zfc-pcf2-scale.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,J,\\vec f,\\delta\\in V\">\\(A,J,\\vec f,\\delta\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2Scale}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2Scale}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3ScaleUglyPoint}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3ScaleUglyPoint}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf3\\text{-}scale\\text{-}ugly\\text{-}point}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3ScaleUglyPoint}_S(A,J,\\vec f,\\delta)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\lambda\\;\\left(\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2Scale}_S(A,J,\\lambda,\\vec f)\\land\\delta&lt;\\lambda\\land\\operatorname{Lim}(\\delta)\\land\\exists g\\in\\prod A\\;\\forall\\alpha&lt;\\delta\\;\\exists\\beta\\;\\left(\\alpha&lt;\\beta&lt;\\delta\\land\\{a\\in A:g(a)&lt;\\vec f(\\alpha)(a)\\}\\setminus\\{a\\in A:g(a)&lt;\\vec f(\\beta)(a)\\}\\in J\\land\\{a\\in A:g(a)&lt;\\vec f(\\beta)(a)\\}\\setminus\\{a\\in A:g(a)&lt;\\vec f(\\alpha)(a)\\}\\notin J\\right)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf3\\text{-}scale\\text{-}ugly\\text{-}point}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3ScaleUglyPoint}_S(A,J,\\vec f,\\delta)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\lambda\\;\\left(\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2Scale}_S(A,J,\\lambda,\\vec f)\\land\\delta&lt;\\lambda\\land\\operatorname{Lim}(\\delta)\\land\\exists g\\in\\prod A\\;\\forall\\alpha&lt;\\delta\\;\\exists\\beta\\;\\left(\\alpha&lt;\\beta&lt;\\delta\\land\\{a\\in A:g(a)&lt;\\vec f(\\alpha)(a)\\}\\setminus\\{a\\in A:g(a)&lt;\\vec f(\\beta)(a)\\}\\in J\\land\\{a\\in A:g(a)&lt;\\vec f(\\beta)(a)\\}\\setminus\\{a\\in A:g(a)&lt;\\vec f(\\alpha)(a)\\}\\notin J\\right)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Ugliness means that the threshold sets <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_\\alpha\">\\(T_\\alpha\\)</span> form a strictly increasing sequence modulo <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\">\\(J\\)</span> cofinally below <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta\">\\(\\delta\\)</span>, rather than merely crossing one function once.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3